async function openFraudGraph(instrumentId){try{const g=await api.fraudGraph(instrumentId);const nodes=g.nodes||[],edges=g.edges||[];const html=`<div class="certificate-modal-overlay open" onclick="if(event.target===this)this.remove()"><section class="certificate-modal" style="max-width:980px"><header class="certificate-modal-head"><div><span class="eyebrow page-eyebrow">Evidence relationships</span><h2>${esc(instrumentId)}</h2><p>Instrument identity, certificates, inspections, complaints, repairs, scans and fraud signals.</p></div><button class="close-btn" onclick="this.closest('.certificate-modal-overlay').remove()">${icon('close')}</button></header><div class="certificate-detail-grid"><article class="certificate-detail-card"><span>Graph counts</span><h3>${nodes.length} nodes · ${edges.length} links</h3><dl>${Object.entries(g.counts||{}).map(([k,v])=>`<dt>${esc(k)}</dt><dd>${esc(v)}</dd>`).join('')}</dl></article><article class="certificate-detail-card"><span>Nodes</span><div class="mini-factor-list">${nodes.slice(0,40).map(n=>`<div><span>${esc(n.type)} · ${esc(n.label)}</span><b>${esc(n.id)}</b></div>`).join('')}</div></article><article class="certificate-detail-card full"><span>Relationships</span><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>From</th><th>Relation</th><th>To</th></tr></thead><tbody>${edges.slice(0,80).map(e=>`<tr><td>${esc(e.source)}</td><td>${esc(e.relation)}</td><td>${esc(e.target)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></article></div></section></div>`;document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',html);}catch(e){showToast(e.message);}}
async function openScanAnalytics(certId){try{const r=await api.scanAnalytics(certId);const html=`<div class="certificate-modal-overlay open" onclick="if(event.target===this)this.remove()"><section class="certificate-modal" style="max-width:760px"><header class="certificate-modal-head"><div><span class="eyebrow page-eyebrow">Public trust telemetry</span><h2>${esc(certId)}</h2><p>Scan frequency and location anomaly signals.</p></div><button class="close-btn" onclick="this.closest('.certificate-modal-overlay').remove()">${icon('close')}</button></header><div class="kpi-grid dashboard-kpis">${dashboardKpi('eye','Total scans',r.totalScans,'','telemetry','teal')}${dashboardKpi('route','Last 24h',r.last24h,'','scan volume','blue')}${dashboardKpi('pin','Locations',r.distinctLocations.length,'','distinct','amber')}${dashboardKpi('warning','Invalid',r.invalidScans,'','trust failures','red')}</div><section class="panel" style="margin-top:16px;padding:16px"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Detected anomalies</h3><span>Derived from recorded public verification events.</span></div></div>${r.anomalies.length?r.anomalies.map(a=>`<div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">${icon('warning')}</div><div><strong>${esc(a.type)}</strong><span>${a.distanceKm} km in ${a.hours} h · ${a.speedKmh} km/h</span></div></div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty-state compact"><p>No impossible-travel transitions detected.</p></div>'}</section></section></div>`;document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',html);}catch(e){showToast(e.message);}}
